{"metadata":{"slug":[{"Plain":"Postnikov塔"},0],"title":[{"Plain":"Postnikov 塔"},2],"tag":[{"Plain":"百科"},3],"ext":[{"Plain":"md"},1],"author":[{"Lazy":[{"Local":{"url":"SimplicialCat","text":"SimplicialCat"}}]},4]},"content":{"Lazy":[{"Plain":"\n<h2>定义</h2>\n<p>"},{"Local":{"url":"生象","text":"生象"}},{"Plain":" (或一般的 "},{"Local":{"url":"∞-意象","text":"$\\infty$-意象"}},{"Plain":"的对象) $X$ 的 <strong>Postnikov 塔</strong>是对 $X$ 逐级"},{"Local":{"url":"截断性","text":"截断"}},{"Plain":"所得的滤\n$$\r\n\\cdots \\to \\tau_{\\leq 1} X \\to \\tau_{\\leq 0} X \\to \\tau_{\\leq -1} X \\to \\tau_{\\leq -2} X = *.\r\n$$</p>\n<h2>性质</h2>\n<h3>纤维</h3>\n<p>对于 $n\\geq 1$, 映射 $\\tau_{\\leq n} X \\to \\tau_{\\leq n-1} X$ 的纤维为 "},{"Local":{"url":"Eilenberg–MacLane空间","text":"Eilenberg–MacLane 空间"}},{"Plain":" $K(\\pi_n(X),n)$.</p>\n<p>在一般的"},{"Local":{"url":"∞-意象","text":"意象"}},{"Plain":" $\\mathcal C$ 中, Postnikov 塔中的映射 $\\tau_{\\leq n} X \\to \\tau_{\\leq n-1} X$ 是"},{"Local":{"url":"俯意象","text":"俯意象"}},{"Plain":" $\\mathcal C_{/ \\tau_{\\leq n-1}X}$ 中的 $n$-截断 $(n-1)$-连通对象, 即 $n$-"},{"Local":{"url":"束","text":"束"}},{"Plain":".</p>\n<h2>相关概念</h2>\n<p>"},{"Local":{"url":"Whitehead塔","text":"Whitehead 塔"}},{"Plain":"</p>\n"}]}}